{"script":"yd_012_04-备份","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1b","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":277.5,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-419,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1b","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":277.5,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-419,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]你问像我这种猎人在休闲的时候会干什么？这个……我并不了解其他猎人，但我可以跟你说说我是怎么样的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]在休猎期，我通常都会维护身上的武器装备。[r]然后就是总结之前的狩猎经验，改进接下来的狩猎方式。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]我在路过旅店的时候，会听到猎人之间讨论如何狩猎的问题。[r]虽然他们讨论的内容五花八门，但他们没有白白浪费休猎期的时间。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]可别把猎人误当成只会战斗的肌肉笨蛋。[r]猎人不用脑子，永远只是另一种形式的猎物罢了。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1e","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":277.5,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-419,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"沃夫加-休闲日"}